# Docs and MDX content

## Sidebar scope

- `sidebars.js` autogenerates from **`docs/learning` only**.
- Routes under `docs/brand.md`, etc. are reached via explicit nav/links — do not expect them in the tutorial sidebar.
- Navbar **Materiály** → `/docs/learning/intro`. NI-APH course copy and APH slides live on that intro page. `docs/courses/aph.md` is a redirect to intro.

## Embedding interactive examples

Import `APHCanvas` from `@site/src/APHCanvas.tsx`. The `name` prop must match a class on `window.APH` from the downloaded examples bundle:

```mdx
import APHCanvas from '@site/src/APHCanvas';

<APHCanvas name={'Tetris'} />
```

Example sources live in **APHGames/examples** (external repo). This site only embeds the prebuilt bundle — do not add example game logic here.

## Slide listing components

- General learning slides: `docs/learning/lectures.tsx` — reads `static/slides/slides-info.json`, filters by `currentLocale` and `!sl.course`.
- APH course slides: `docs/courses/aph_lectures.tsx` — filters `course === 'APH'`, handles `locked === 'true'`.
- Slide HTML is served at `/slides/<file_name>.html` (static, from **APHGames/slides** release).

## Doc slug gotcha

Navbar may link to `/docs/learning/intro` while the file is `docs/learning/01-intro.md`. Confirm URL aliases or update links when renaming intro docs.
